  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Tokenized stocks distributed value rose 15.9% over 30D:</strong> Tokenized equity distributed value at $4.01B (15.9% higher over 30D) shows the early lane still adding balance sheet on a small set of platforms. Related: <a href=\"https://decrypt.co/383040/okx-ice-tokenized-stock-venue-sets-launch-crypto-companies-big-tech-opts-out\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OKX-ICE Tokenized Stock Venue Sets Launch, Turning to Crypto Companies After Big Tech Opts Out</a> (Decrypt).</li><li><strong>Tokenized stocks remain an early-stage lane:</strong> liquidity and scale are still concentrated in a small set of platforms/networks. Related: <a href=\"https://decrypt.co/383129/morning-minute-tokenized-stock-venues-are-launching-without-big-techs-approval\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Morning Minute: Tokenized Stock Venues Are Launching Without Big Tech\u2019s Approval</a> (Decrypt).</li><li><strong>Tokenized equities remain an early access market:</strong> Liquidity and scale stay concentrated until broker distribution and custody plumbing can support broader trading. Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OKXICE sets Nov. 23 launch for tokenized securities venue under SEC innovation exemption</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Securities and broker-rule constraints often set the pace more than listing count, so near-term share stays tied to venues that can actually distribute products. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/dtcc-plans-solana-expansion-wallet-rules-limit-access?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DTCC Plans Solana Expansion as Wallet Rules Limit Access</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
